{"asset_key":"ep7/env_story_17323600","episode":"ep7","category":"env_story","story_id":"17323600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1732360001:1":{"text":"모르셨어요? 상회는 판매량을 늘리고 부당한 대우를 받지 않기 위해 만들어진 단체예요.","source_cn":"你不知道吗？行会就是为了更好销售货物不受欺负抱团组成的组织。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3E8E7114B687F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1732360002:1":{"text":"상회에 가입하면 판매처나 정보도 공유하고, 물건 공급도 도와주죠.","source_cn":"加入行会就可以共享销售渠道和消息，同时行会还能帮我们分...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28A501D694A15D94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1732360003:1":{"text":"이번 고대의 전당 사건이 업계에 영향이 크지 않으면 좋겠는데요.","source_cn":"希望这次圣古堂的事情，不要影响到我们行业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42259A7EBDDEFA41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:手工业者莉娜":{"text":"수공업자 리나","source":"手工业者莉娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:手工业者卡拉":{"text":"수공업자 카라","source":"手工业者卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}